+// Identity token of this backend's relay provider -- the same opaque pointer
+// the relay evidence lines print as provider=%p. It is an identity, not a
+// handle: never dereference it, never free it, and never use it after the
+// backend has been freed. The value is stable while the backend is alive and
+// is null for a null backend, a non-Meta backend, or a Meta backend without a
+// live relay provider. This call does not synchronize with concurrent
+// backend teardown; callers must hold the backend owner's lifetime.
+GGML_API const void * ggml_backend_relay_provider(ggml_backend_t backend);
